      "refersTo": "recording-panel-dark",
      "description": "Horizontal microphone/readiness group beside model selection; stacks below 760px.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-record\"><div class=\"ds-state\"><button class=\"ds-mic\" aria-label=\"Start recording\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"12\" rx=\"3\"/><path d=\"M5 10v2a7 7 0 0 0 14 0v-2M12 19v3m-4 0h8\"/></svg></button><div><strong>Ready to dictate</strong><small>Hold your shortcut to speak</small></div></div><label class=\"ds-model\">Model<select aria-label=\"Model\"><option>Selected recognition model</option></select></label></section>",
      "css": ".ds-record{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(210px,280px);gap:24px;align-items:center;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--color-border,#34383E);border-radius:14px;background:var(--color-bg-elevated,#1B1D20);color:var(--color-text-primary,#F3F4F5);font-family:var(--font-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif)}.ds-state{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center}.ds-state strong{font-size:21px;font-weight:550}.ds-state small{display:block;font-size:11px;color:var(--color-text-secondary,#A4A8B0);margin-top:7px}.ds-mic{width:65px;height:65px;border:0;border-radius:16px;background:var(--color-accent,#79A9FF);color:var(--color-text-inverse,#101112);cursor:pointer}.ds-mic:hover{background:var(--color-accent-hover,#9BBFFF)}.ds-mic:active{background:var(--color-accent-active,#6395ED)}.ds-mic:focus-visible,.ds-model select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-accent,#79A9FF);outline-offset:3px}.ds-model{font-size:11px;color:var(--color-text-secondary,#A4A8B0)}.ds-model select{display:block;width:100%;margin-top:7px;min-height:38px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--color-border,#34383E);border-radius:7px;background:var(--color-bg-secondary,#17191C);color:var(--color-text-primary,#F3F4F5)}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-record{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}}"
